window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In the unforgiving land of ancient Caledonia, a bloodline of chieftains rises up against insurmountable challenges. From brutal tribal clashes to powerful Roman invaders, they wage war to protect their sacred land, guided by the wisdom of mystical druids and the formidable will of old gods.</p> <p>With Roman walls slicing through their homeland, Lachlan — heir to the legendary Calgacus - must unite the tribes and harness ancient magic to resist the invaders. Aided by divine visions and a mythical warhound, Lachlan emerges as a warrior destined to lead his people.</p> <p>Together with his son Arawn, the two face battles of both swords and spirit, and reshape the fate and future of their people.</p> <p>A sweeping historical fantasy adventure, John Broughton's <i>Caledonia</i> is a journey into the heart of a land that refused to be conquered.</p>"; 
